tmi16_y: open call=w1                       ; OPEN: two words with no act (the call and the shared delay's 1)
    strict rl=2 bus=RSV jmp=tmi_i           ; BY P P2: strict bus-idle (spec 16 A1, inferred), the reserving word (spec 13 A1); the displacement released; then the [BW] routine's words from the immediate's pops

